  <!-- ============================================================
       大型監視塔（次要結構）。DMS.GenStep_ArsenalSite 依標籤 DMS_ArsenalWatchtower 挑選，2~6 座圍在核心外圍，
       以「從核心看過去的方向」旋轉，所以作者的南側（z=0）一律朝向核心，道路支線也從這一側接進來。
       每座都由一台變電箱供電（暗管連到掃描塔與砲塔）：駭入或摧毀變電箱，這座塔的砲塔就停擺。

       Large watchtowers (secondary structures). DMS.GenStep_ArsenalSite picks them by the DMS_ArsenalWatchtower tag and
       rings 2~6 round the core, rotated by their direction from the core, so the authored south side (z=0) always faces
       the core and the branch road joins there. Each runs off one substation cabinet (hidden conduit to the sentry tower
       and turrets): hack or destroy the cabinet and that tower's guns go quiet.
       ============================================================ -->

